PETSELFTEST1
# V4-06 mini games with the built-in set: three games, dial steps only.
# Needs no TF pack: take /games/default.kpg off the card (or expect
# src=pack). Run outside the quiet hours (default 20:30-07:00) and above
# the low-battery level, or the Game item only says hi (PET_GAME_REFUSED).
# Seed 4242 plays (tests/cpp/test_mini_game.cc checks the same order):
#   1) heart: third card   2) circle: second card   3) one block: third card
# Counted from "mark begin" (see tools/selftest_report.py).
# Games are UI only: no pet commits.
# expect commits 0
# expect min:PET_GAME_START 3
# expect min:src=builtin 3
# expect none:PET_GAME_REFUSED 0
# expect none:PET_GAME_START_FAILED 0
# Game 1: right, reveal (two wrong presses), try again then right.
# expect min:right=1 2
# expect min:feedback=reveal 1
# expect min:feedback=try_again 2
# expect min:end=completed 1
# expect min:growth=1 1
# Game 2: long press goes home. Game 3: nobody plays, home after 60 s.
# expect min:end=home 1
# expect min:end=idle 1
# expect min:PET_GAME_QUEUED 8
# expect none:PET_SELFTEST_ABORT 0
# expect selftest_done 1
# expect max_partial_ms 2500
# expect timescale 50
# Quiet prompts while testing (RAM only, this boot).
volume 15
# TEST ONLY: the "nobody plays" timers (question again 12 s, home 60 s) at
# 50 %; the answers below come well inside 6 s. "twait" scales with it;
# right/reveal holds and refreshes stay real ("wait").
# Real speed: timescale 100 (selftest_report.py --timescale 100).
timescale 50
# Start as soon as XiaoZhi is idle (Wi-Fi up, activated), not after a
# fixed 20 s; the pet toggle below still retries.
waitidle 60000
pet
wait 6000
# Normalize restored pet state to "home, neutral".
tap press 6000
hold press 1500 6000
mark begin
# Home rail: left end (Chat), then two to the right = Game.
tap up 800
tap up 800
tap up 800
tap up 800
tap down 800
tap down 2000
# Game 1 (full refresh into the game, then the question tone).
game 4242
tap press 8000
# Round 1: the heart is the third card: right first time.
tap down 1500
tap down 1500
tap press 5000
# Round 2: the circle is the second card; the first one twice:
# "try another", then TuanTuan shows the answer (no reward).
tap press 2500
tap press 6000
# Round 3: one block = one dot, the third card. Second card first.
tap down 1500
tap press 2500
tap down 1500
tap press 9000
# Game 2: a long press goes home at once.
game 4242
tap press 8000
tap down 1500
hold press 1500 8000
# Game 3: nobody plays: the question again after 12 s, home after 60 s
# (scaled, counted from the question).
game 4242
tap press 8000
twait 60000
wait 6000
end
